{% set local_problem %}
<p>New Hope's wooded character is beautiful but hard on gutters. Pine needles accumulate year-round. Hardwood leaves pile up in fall. And debris compacts over time into gutter-clogging sludge that doesn't drain.</p>

<p>Clogged gutters don't just look bad — they damage your home. Water overflows, erodes landscaping, and pools against foundations. On New Hope's often-sloped lots, that water can cause serious problems fast.</p>

<p>Professional cleaning is faster, safer, and more thorough than DIY attempts. We have the equipment to handle any height and the experience to spot problems before they become expensive repairs.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We remove all debris by hand — leaves, needles, shingle grit, and accumulated gunk. We don't just blow debris around or push it into downspouts.</p>

<p>Next, we flush all downspouts to ensure they're clear. Clogged downspouts are common and make clean gutters useless.</p>

<p>Finally, we inspect your system for problems: loose hangers, small leaks, fascia damage. You'll know the condition of your gutters when we're done.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've been cleaning gutters in eastern Madison County for over 20 years. We understand rural and semi-rural properties with their heavier tree coverage and sometimes challenging access.</p>

<p>When we're done, we clean up completely. No debris in your yard, no mess on your driveway.</p>
{% endset %}
